  "description": "*\"Do you believe in fate?\"* \n\n'Shin', a potential candidate who could become the absolute god by simply guiding the fate of the 100th human, meets Han Ha-Na, who was being bullied because she is blind.\nIn the process of helping Han Ha-Na, who has little time left to live, for promotion, he learns that she was the only mistake he had made in the past and that it was the reason she lost her eyesight. \n\nAs time passes, Shin comes to truly love Han Ha-Na and tries to right his mistakes. \n\n(source: Bomtoon, translated)",
